<title>USA: NHP Q1 continuing ops EBIDTA $0.55 vs $0.48.</title>
<headline>NHP Q1 continuing ops EBIDTA $0.55 vs $0.48.</headline>
<text>
<p>PHOENIX, Arizona, April 30 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.17		    $0.22</p>
<p> Net			  2,226		    2,803</p>
<p> Revs			18,362		   15,273</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,040		   13,040</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Company reported Q1 continuing operations EBIDTA of $0.55 per common and equivalent shares outstanding  as of the end of the quarter vs $0.48, a 13.3 percent increase over the first quarter of 1996, due primarily to acquisitions of additional property management rights in 1996 and early 1997.</p>
</text>
